20	// DEVDESK-471 step 1 (red phase): the trace sub-level (StateTrace) becomes
21	// self-sufficient. H on the Local route row opens it without tracing, enter
22	// starts or restarts the trace, ctrl+o opens "Trace from", esc cancels then
23	// goes back to where the user came from. The Path tab still exists at this
24	// step. These tests name no API that does not exist yet (the "ready" state is
25	// read through isTraceReady); they fail on behaviour.
